---
// Features/Services section component
// Highlights the 4 main reasons to choose Century Digital
---

<section id="services" class="w-full bg-gray-50 scroll-mt-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
	<div class="section-inner flex flex-col gap-4">
		<div class="text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
			<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900">
				4 Reasons Why Century Digital Will Make You A Winner
			</h2>
			<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl self-center">
				There's a better way. Stop doing what you've been told "works." No more "call 'em til they buy or die" mentality.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
			<!-- Feature 1 -->
			<div class="feature-box bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal group shadow-sm">
				<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3b82f6] to-[#60a5fa] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-md">
					<span class="text-4xl">🎯</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 gradient-text">Filtered Leads, On Demand</h3>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
					Our signature educational funnels are guaranteed to deliver appointments ready to invest in their families' future and safety. Less leads, yet more sales. Every contract owner is pre-qualified and understands the value of protecting their principal.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 2 -->
			<div class="feature-box bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal group shadow-sm">
				<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3b82f6] to-[#60a5fa] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-md">
					<span class="text-4xl">📞</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 gradient-text">Internal Sales Team</h3>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
					Your personal ISA (Internal Sales Agent) calls to confirm and pre-sell your appointments, getting them excited for their call with you, the expert. Our team helps eliminate your no-show rate. You focus on writing paper, not dialing disconnected numbers.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 3 -->
			<div class="feature-box bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal group shadow-sm">
				<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3b82f6] to-[#60a5fa] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-md">
					<span class="text-4xl">🎓</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 gradient-text">Sales Veteran Training</h3>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
					Our team is full of producers writing $50k+ AP every month. They host trainings for everyone inside Century Digital to drive up your close rate and help families get protected. Learn from MDRT qualifiers who've been in the trenches.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 4 -->
			<div class="feature-box bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal group shadow-sm">
				<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3b82f6] to-[#60a5fa] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-md">
					<span class="text-4xl">🤖</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 gradient-text">AI Automations</h3>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
					Not only does your ISA go out and do the heavy lifting for you; we are powered by AI to communicate with leads and get them on your calendar. Most importantly, we get them excited to see the living benefits of a policy. No more chasing, just closing.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="text-center">
			<a href="#contact" class="btn-cta inline-flex items-center justify-center min-w-[220px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1e40af] to-[#1e293b] rounded-2xl text-xl font-semibold hover:from-[#1e3a8a] hover:to-[#0f172a] transition-all transform hover:scale-105 text-white">
				Book a Call →
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

